WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.080
Pi Han-wool.

2
00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.650
We must send him to the disciplinary committee.

3
00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:15.490
Then we will go to the disciplinary committee too.

4
00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:18.110
You might even get expelled.

5
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:20.510
I don't care.

6
00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.370
Then we don't care either.

7
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:25.780
That's right.

8
00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:28.260
But by the way,

9
00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:34.140
The teacher who tried to send Pi Han-wool
to the disciplinary committee a year ago...

10
00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:37.390
Was killed the night before the disciplinary committee.

11
00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:38.400
What?

12
00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:41.659
Even though the police said it was a random murder,

13
00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:44.459
Everyone at Yuseong Tech thinks Pi Han-wool did it.

14
00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:45.750
They secretly believe that.

15
00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:49.010
What? Just to stop a mere disciplinary committee?

16
00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.399
That's unbelievable.

17
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.210
Even if it's Pi Han-wool, murder is...

18
00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:57.160
Because it's related to expulsion.

19
00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.929
For Pi Han-wool, Yuseong Tech isn't just a school.

20
00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:02.550
It's a kingdom he built himself.

21
00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:04.570
But if he gets kicked out of here,

22
00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:08.310
It wouldn't just hurt his pride.

23
00:01:09.510 --> 00:01:11.390
For the Yeonbaek Gang's designated succession system,

24
00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:13.150
It would also be a massive blow.

25
00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:22.410
Then no one would fear Pi Han-wool anymore.

26
00:01:24.530 --> 00:01:26.040
He's really running wild, risking his life.

27
00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:28.869
Anyway,

28
00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:30.899
To cancel the disciplinary committee, Pi Han-wool...

29
00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:32.810
Won't care what means or methods he uses.

30
00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.860
What are you thinking about?

31
00:01:36.861 --> 00:01:38.859
Shouldn't we just strike Pi Han-wool first?

32
00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:40.290
-Right. -No.

33
00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:43.749
-Why? -What if we fail?

34
00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:46.149
Hey, why are you thinking about failing first?

35
00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:48.200
This concerns Teacher Han-kyung's safety.

36
00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:50.360
We must be absolutely cautious.

37
00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:54.290
-But... -Se-hyun is right.

38
00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:58.150
We can't let Teacher Han-kyung get involved, not even a little bit.

39
00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:08.820
Then what should we do?

40
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:13.530
Until the disciplinary committee convenes...

41
00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:16.460
We must protect Teacher Han-kyung.

42
00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:21.059
(3rd Period: English Domain, Odd Type)

43
00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:22.290
(Korean Domain, 3rd Period: English Domain, Odd Type,
Math Domain)

44
00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.099
(Those who want to study, gather around!)

45
00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:33.369
(Hwang Min-hyun)

46
00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:35.469
(Han Ji-eun)

47
00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:36.910
(Cha Woo-min)

48
00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:48.289
(Lee Jong-hyun)

49
00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:49.520
(Shin Soo-hyun)

50
00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.890
(Yoon Sang-jung, Gong Do-yoo)

51
00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:03.000
"Study Group"

52
00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:07.500
Excuse me, regarding the investigation of the violence case involving the kids...

53
00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:10.270
Is there any progress?

54
00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:14.739
The Yeonbaek Gang seems to be keeping things completely airtight.

55
00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:17.100
Finding this witness is really not easy.

56
00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:20.770
But Teacher...

57
00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:25.490
How about you avoid the school for a while?

58
00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:28.210
We don't know what Pi Han-wool might do.

59
00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.760
Although I will do my best to protect your personal safety...

60
00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.150
That also...

61
00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:33.990
Has its limits.

62
00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:38.430
Are you telling me to run away right now?

63
00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:41.919
Come back after the disciplinary committee is over.

64
00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:43.900
If a teacher runs away out of fear,

65
00:03:44.630 --> 00:03:46.460
Won't the students just learn and do the same?

66
00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:50.030
They are people who even spread fake news.

67
00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:52.890
We don't know what tricks they will pull.

68
00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:55.420
I have to protect the kids at the disciplinary committee.

69
00:03:57.020 --> 00:03:59.560
(Pi Han-wool Disciplinary Committee, 1 Day Left)

70
00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:15.140
(Vice Principal)

71
00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:28.810
It's me, Teacher Lee Han-kyung.

72
00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:31.320
Calling me at this hour, what's the matter?

73
00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:35.530
Are you really not going to give up on the disciplinary committee?

74
00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:40.799
I'll pretend I didn't hear that. I'm hanging up.

75
00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:42.280
Wait, wait, wait.

76
00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.550
If you're really determined to do this...

77
00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:49.150
I have something to tell you.

78
00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:50.679
About Yuseong Tech,

79
00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:54.710
And the dirty deeds the Yeonbaek Foundation has done all along.

80
00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:57.710
Why must it be...

81
00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:01.319
Tonight that you say this?

82
00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:03.010
Because it really seems like...

83
00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:06.700
The disciplinary committee will actually happen tomorrow.

84
00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:33.610
Teacher.

85
00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:35.710
Are you really going into the school right now?

86
00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:38.110
Will it be okay?

87
00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:42.180
Didn't the Vice Principal say he was going to make a confession of conscience?

88
00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:44.349
I have to hear what he has to say.

89
00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:46.070
Today is the day before the disciplinary committee.

90
00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:47.980
What if...

91
00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:50.370
He has other intentions?

92
00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:53.339
Even if that's the case,

93
00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:54.470
This is an opportunity.

94
00:06:27.350 --> 00:06:29.440
As Teacher Lee also knows,

95
00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:32.650
Yuseong Tech is not normal.

96
00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:35.589
It's an open secret that the Yeonbaek Foundation...

97
00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:37.939
Is used for money laundering as a political fund for Chairman Pi Yeon-baek.

98
00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:39.610
It's an open secret.

99
00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.240
Because his dad is the supreme ruler of Yuseong Tech,

100
00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:46.020
Naturally, no one can touch Pi Han-wool.

101
00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:47.340
In the end,

102
00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:51.850
The school has been raising a monster.

103
00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:58.010
Preparations for the disciplinary committee...

104
00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:00.219
Are comprehensive, right?

105
00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:02.280
Yes, please don't worry.

106
00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.419
We have statements from the victimized students,

107
00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:07.370
And testimonies from the teachers.

108
00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:13.070
You're amazing, Teacher Lee Han-kyung.

109
00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:17.060
I'm truly touched.

110
00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:19.110
You too, Vice Principal.

111
00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:22.140
Thank you for finding the courage.

112
00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:42.120
Vice Principal?

113
00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:51.810
Vice Principal.

114
00:07:52.890 --> 00:07:53.790
Where did he go?

115
00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:06.570
(Bang Sang-in, 2nd Year, Yeonbaek Gang Faction of 4)

116
00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:09.610
(Choo Jae-hwang, 2nd Year, Yeonbaek Gang Faction of 4)

117
00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:14.710
Surprise!

118
00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:33.430
I feel like I've seen this exact scene before.

119
00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:37.050
I think we came to see you for a similar matter before, right?

120
00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:38.690
What did you say back then?

121
00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:41.939
Ah, 'If you want to take up someone else's time,'

122
00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:45.070
'You should ask for their understanding, not use threats.'

123
00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:49.660
Wow, seriously...

124
00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:53.020
I was so fucking moved back then.

125
00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:55.990
So?

126
00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:58.630
Today, I'm going to ask for your understanding first.

127
00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:00.740
Teacher Lee Han-kyung.

128
00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:06.580
Hand it over. While I'm still asking nicely.

129
00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:08.499
Nicely my ass.

130
00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:10.560
Hand it over quickly, you bitch.

131
00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:14.220
What a pain.

132
00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:17.079
Please give it to me.

133
00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:18.520
Please give it to me.

134
00:09:20.010 --> 00:09:21.310
Please give it to me.

135
00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:26.100
Are you recording?

136
00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:29.840
Confiscated.

137
00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.060
Come on.

138
00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:37.140
Are you guys... really planning to hurt me?

139
00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:39.420
What's wrong?

140
00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:42.589
Did you think what happened to that teacher last year was just a rumor?

141
00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:45.070
Even if I'm gone and the disciplinary committee is canceled,

142
00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:47.580
Your mistakes won't disappear.

143
00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:50.240
So please stop here, Pi Han-wool.

144
00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:53.830
I'm giving you one last chance.

145
00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:02.530
You seem to have misunderstood something.

146
00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:08.180
All this time...

147
00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:10.990
I was the one giving you chances.

148
00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:13.560
Teacher Lee Han-kyung.

149
00:10:15.620 --> 00:10:20.060
The police will be here soon.

150
00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:29.460
This recording came out clear, right?

151
00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:30.670
Yes.

152
00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:34.190
But...

153
00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:36.650
Did you really have to go this far?

154
00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:42.570
I wanted to personally become the evidence.

155
00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:48.370
Just 30 minutes.

156
00:10:48.970 --> 00:10:50.489
If I haven't heard from you by then,

157
00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:51.440
I'm going in to find you.

158
00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:10.590
Detective Na Tae-man?

159
00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:38.680
Mic test, 1, 2.

160
00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:41.150
Can you hear me, you psychos?

161
00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:43.449
You're all dead.

162
00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:47.940
You fucking bastards.

163
00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:21.819
Pi Han-wool's disciplinary committee...

164
00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:23.369
Will be held at 10 AM, 4 days from now.

165
00:12:23.370 --> 00:12:24.399
4 days later, 10 AM.

166
00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:26.889
We just need to stick close and protect Teacher Han-kyung during this time, right?

167
00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:28.959
-Yeah. -3 days is 72 hours.

168
00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:31.019
-72 hours. -Round the clock, absolutely no problem.

169
00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.100
Everyone.

170
00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:35.909
Make sure to act carefully.

171
00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:38.139
If a teacher runs away out of fear,

172
00:12:38.140 --> 00:12:40.380
What can the students learn from me?

173
00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:48.089
-Is this okay? -Teacher.

174
00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:49.750
But I don't know this question either.

175
00:12:50.730 --> 00:12:51.710
This question?

176
00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:54.269
I'm a bit confused by this one too.

177
00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:56.439
It might take some time.

178
00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:57.479
-Let's take a look. -This one too.

179
00:12:57.480 --> 00:12:58.900
Are you heading back to school now?

180
00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:02.149
The disciplinary committee is tomorrow.

181
00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:04.260
What if they have ulterior motives...

182
00:13:05.140 --> 00:13:06.370
If that's really the case,

183
00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:07.900
Then this is an opportunity.

184
00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:16.310
Students.

185
00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:18.420
Why are you here?

186
00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:20.669
Fuck.

187
00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:22.870
You're those arrogant 1st years, huh.

188
00:13:24.390 --> 00:13:25.280
Can you move?

189
00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:27.680
Our teacher needs a good night's sleep today,

190
00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.329
Because there's a super important event tomorrow.

191
00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:31.230
The disciplinary committee.

192
00:13:31.231 --> 00:13:32.480
Wow.

193
00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:36.450
Are these little kids here to save their teacher?

194
00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:38.379
So scary.

195
00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:39.310
Damn it...

196
00:13:39.311 --> 00:13:40.530
You picked the wrong side.

197
00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:41.930
Soon-chul, bro.

198
00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:44.129
Stop talking nonsense.

199
00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:45.490
Bring it all on, fuck...

200
00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:48.049
Joon, you and Teacher Han-kyung leave first.

201
00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:48.910
What?

202
00:13:48.911 --> 00:13:50.740
Why do I have to leave?

203
00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:54.150
Because I trust you the most.

204
00:13:55.420 --> 00:13:56.670
You mean that, right?

205
00:13:57.280 --> 00:13:58.480
That's great.

206
00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:01.470
Damn.

207
00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.430
Fuck.

208
00:14:05.890 --> 00:14:07.000
Fuck.

209
00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:10.319
Teacher, let's go.

210
00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:11.260
-Teacher, run! -Hurry!

211
00:14:11.261 --> 00:14:12.740
-Students... -Hurry...

212
00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:37.150
These bastards.

213
00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:52.180
Faster than I thought.

214
00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:03.969
Joon, you guys go first.

215
00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:05.079
What?

216
00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:06.030
Se-hyun!

217
00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:10.929
Teacher, hurry.

218
00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.620
-Let's go. -No.

219
00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:23.840
Lee Joon.

220
00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:31.590
Wow.

221
00:15:34.590 --> 00:15:36.420
Long time no see, Joon.

222
00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:38.670
Anti.

223
00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:41.479
I'm a Yeonbaek Gang member now,

224
00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:43.120
So don't come looking for me anymore.

225
00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:48.690
Teacher, you go first.

226
00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:50.610
Joon!

227
00:15:50.611 --> 00:15:52.440
If you don't get out, I'm going to be yelled at to death.

228
00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:54.280
Please get out quickly.

229
00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:55.540
Hurry!

230
00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:58.080
Teacher Lee Han-kyung!

231
00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:01.910
If I chase her right now, I could probably take her out,

232
00:16:02.880 --> 00:16:04.970
But honestly, I kinda want to fight you once.

233
00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:31.380
How did you get here?

234
00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:34.529
Because Han-wool bro told me...

235
00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:36.050
Yuseong Tech is lacking talent scouts.

236
00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:39.680
The 'family' you talked about...

237
00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:42.250
Was just being Pi Han-wool's lackey after all?

238
00:16:44.340 --> 00:16:45.560
Pi Han-wool?

239
00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:57.930
Hey.

240
00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:02.860
A loser like you who only gets beaten up until he cries...

241
00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:04.980
Dares to casually say someone else's name?

242
00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:18.090
I should really thank Han-wool

243
00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:20.779
For giving me a chance at revenge.

244
00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:22.189
Come on, step aside, step aside.

245
00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:23.700
What's your motive for murder?

246
00:17:49.690 --> 00:17:50.480
Please step back.

247
00:17:50.481 --> 00:17:51.790
The crime of ambushing my dad...

248
00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:54.600
I'll start by breaking one of your arms.

249
00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:10.670
Damn it.

250
00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:14.770
Where did your bravado go, loser?

251
00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:17.700
This guy is tough to handle.

252
00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:28.850
"Hide well, don't let your hair show."

253
00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:39.970
Bingo.

254
00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:50.870
How interesting.

255
00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:53.779
It's been a while since I had a back-and-forth fight like this.

256
00:19:53.780 --> 00:19:55.320
Why do you have to go this far?

257
00:19:58.650 --> 00:19:59.800
Enduring pain.

258
00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:03.630
Suffering torment.

259
00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:09.550
And being pushed astray.

260
00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:15.540
We want to study but can't.

261
00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:20.380
A school isn't a place like this.

262
00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:41.040
I'm the one who wants to ask why you have to go this far.

263
00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:44.490
What?

264
00:20:44.491 --> 00:20:46.699
If you just obediently cancel the disciplinary committee,

265
00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:49.350
Lee Han-kyung and your friends won't get hurt.

266
00:20:50.360 --> 00:20:51.210
Shut up.

267
00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:10.370
What should I do?

268
00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:12.929
What's with that look?

269
00:21:12.930 --> 00:21:14.280
What are you gonna do with those wide eyes?

270
00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:20.340
Want me to gouge your eyeballs out?

271
00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:22.870
Anti. Why?

272
00:21:24.740 --> 00:21:28.590
Hey. You dyed your hair red so you'd look strong and no one would dare mess with you.

273
00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:30.260
Haven't you read "Slam Dunk"?

274
00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:52.460
What made you fall this far?

275
00:21:53.560 --> 00:21:54.680
I thought that if I just got stronger,

276
00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:57.070
I could stay with you forever.

277
00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:00.870
Are you crazy?

278
00:22:05.120 --> 00:22:06.020
Fuck.

279
00:22:23.040 --> 00:22:24.050
Idiot.

280
00:22:24.590 --> 00:22:26.150
A one-on-one is really easy.

281
00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:45.320
Bang.

282
00:22:45.920 --> 00:22:46.740
It's over here.

283
00:22:54.650 --> 00:22:55.520
Damn it.

284
00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:03.199
Who permitted you to fight one-on-one?

285
00:23:03.200 --> 00:23:05.540
Fuck, that short girl.

286
00:23:06.060 --> 00:23:08.279
A two-on-two means fighting two people.

287
00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:10.249
Thug duo vs. Study Group.

288
00:23:10.250 --> 00:23:11.910
Let's see whose teamwork is better.

289
00:23:41.130 --> 00:23:42.500
Your luck has run out.

290
00:23:45.770 --> 00:23:47.110
You can't rely on gear anymore.

291
00:24:32.730 --> 00:24:34.000
From now on,

292
00:24:35.710 --> 00:24:37.499
Let me teach you a good lesson.

293
00:24:37.500 --> 00:24:39.380
Fuck, you loser.

294
00:25:58.640 --> 00:26:00.910
-Choo-hwang. -Let go.

295
00:26:08.760 --> 00:26:10.010
Lee Ji-woo, snap out of it.

296
00:26:10.960 --> 00:26:12.340
Focus on the basics.

297
00:26:22.690 --> 00:26:24.319
Why are you swinging wildly?

298
00:26:24.320 --> 00:26:25.750
Just mastering the basics is enough.

299
00:26:26.140 --> 00:26:27.150
What are you saying, punk?

300
00:26:31.440 --> 00:26:33.259
Look at those people who get perfect scores on the CSAT.

301
00:26:33.260 --> 00:26:34.710
They all say they only study the textbook.

302
00:26:35.280 --> 00:26:38.160
Don't be greedy. Mastering the basics is enough.

303
00:27:04.180 --> 00:27:06.050
You want me to teach you martial arts?

304
00:27:07.570 --> 00:27:10.230
I want to be Ga-min's strength too.

305
00:27:12.340 --> 00:27:13.719
I'm willing to do anything.

306
00:27:13.720 --> 00:27:15.000
You can't use violence.

307
00:27:17.220 --> 00:27:18.130
However...

308
00:27:19.220 --> 00:27:21.120
If you want to protect something precious,

309
00:27:23.540 --> 00:27:25.280
There are times when you have to fight.

310
00:27:25.660 --> 00:27:28.520
So what did you learn from Ga-min's mom?

311
00:27:29.870 --> 00:27:31.769
I've never hit anyone in my life,

312
00:27:31.770 --> 00:27:33.350
And I'm terrified of being hit.

313
00:27:33.740 --> 00:27:35.459
Auntie said there are only three things

314
00:27:35.460 --> 00:27:36.850
Someone like me can do.

315
00:27:37.700 --> 00:27:38.480
What's the first thing?

316
00:27:39.010 --> 00:27:39.950
You have to be able to take a beating.

317
00:27:40.520 --> 00:27:41.460
To be precise...

318
00:27:45.100 --> 00:27:47.500
It's the guts to not blink even when getting hit.

319
00:27:58.720 --> 00:27:59.570
Damn it.

320
00:28:00.300 --> 00:28:01.289
Hey.

321
00:28:01.290 --> 00:28:03.700
Wow, look at your endurance.

322
00:28:05.560 --> 00:28:07.070
Looks like you got some training at Yuseong Tech.

323
00:28:08.360 --> 00:28:08.970
Really?

324
00:28:12.630 --> 00:28:14.070
Then what's the second thing?

325
00:28:15.650 --> 00:28:16.730
Memorize the vital points.

326
00:28:18.950 --> 00:28:20.450
(Vital Points)

327
00:28:37.080 --> 00:28:38.170
Fuck.

328
00:28:47.210 --> 00:28:48.210
The last thing is...

329
00:28:48.700 --> 00:28:49.620
Hand technique.

330
00:28:52.600 --> 00:28:53.630
During sparring...

331
00:28:54.000 --> 00:28:54.960
You have to use the Phoenix Eye Fist.

332
00:28:57.100 --> 00:28:58.830
Fuck.

333
00:28:59.790 --> 00:29:02.660
To think I got beaten by this scrawny kid...

334
00:29:04.890 --> 00:29:06.290
Or maybe you should go get a master too.

335
00:29:50.950 --> 00:29:52.480
This isn't your full strength, right?

336
00:29:54.210 --> 00:29:55.070
Don't tell me...

337
00:29:55.810 --> 00:29:57.740
You think wasting some time with me...

338
00:29:58.320 --> 00:30:00.740
Will let Lee Han-kyung escape from here?

339
00:30:03.620 --> 00:30:04.400
What?

340
00:30:08.520 --> 00:30:10.080
You underestimate me too much.

341
00:30:11.510 --> 00:30:12.819
I'm truly disappointed.

342
00:30:12.820 --> 00:30:13.520
You...

343
00:30:15.020 --> 00:30:16.690
What are you planning to do to Teacher Han-kyung?

344
00:30:36.300 --> 00:30:37.070
How about it?

345
00:30:37.700 --> 00:30:39.080
Are you willing to use your full strength now?

346
00:30:53.370 --> 00:30:55.140
(Uncle's Forbidden Technique, 4th Move)

347
00:30:57.270 --> 00:31:00.110
(One-Inch Punch, Fa Jin)

348
00:31:33.150 --> 00:31:34.990
I will completely crush you.

349
00:31:36.080 --> 00:31:38.350
So a guy like you won't even dare to dream.

350
00:31:49.020 --> 00:31:51.850
Didn't I say that putting in effort is completely useless?

351
00:31:53.460 --> 00:31:55.620
Did you think Yuseong Tech would change if I disappeared?

352
00:32:00.680 --> 00:32:02.420
Even if I disappear,

353
00:32:03.390 --> 00:32:05.680
Yuseong Tech won't change.

354
00:32:07.330 --> 00:32:08.430
Absolutely not.

355
00:32:22.190 --> 00:32:24.890
(Uncle's Forbidden Technique, 10th Move, Jun Fan)

356
00:32:47.970 --> 00:32:49.620
There's nothing that can't be changed.

357
00:32:51.310 --> 00:32:52.240
I...

358
00:32:52.860 --> 00:32:53.770
No.

359
00:32:55.020 --> 00:32:56.470
We will show you.

360
00:33:08.670 --> 00:33:09.580
Teacher.

361
00:33:21.580 --> 00:33:23.139
-Come here. -She's alone.

362
00:33:23.140 --> 00:33:24.889
-So what? -Get over here.

363
00:33:24.890 --> 00:33:26.300
So many tricks up your sleeve.

364
00:33:27.170 --> 00:33:28.090
What do you want?

365
00:33:29.970 --> 00:33:31.090
-What? -You wanna fight?

366
00:33:31.810 --> 00:33:32.740
What are you trying to do now?

367
00:33:33.440 --> 00:33:34.630
What do you want?

368
00:33:39.100 --> 00:33:40.290
Teacher.

369
00:33:41.430 --> 00:33:42.160
Who is that?

370
00:33:42.650 --> 00:33:44.290
-What's up? -What the hell.

371
00:33:45.350 --> 00:33:46.420
What's going on here?

372
00:33:47.000 --> 00:33:47.990
You come over here.

373
00:33:50.210 --> 00:33:52.140
You have to repay the debt you owe Teacher Han-kyung, right?

374
00:33:54.550 --> 00:33:55.790
Who do you think you are? Why are you being so nosy?

375
00:33:58.090 --> 00:34:00.379
See? You feel pain just from getting pinched.

376
00:34:00.380 --> 00:34:01.420
But Teacher Han-kyung...

377
00:34:02.120 --> 00:34:04.140
Took a knife for you.

378
00:34:09.040 --> 00:34:11.060
I can't live with debt hanging over me. Fuck.

379
00:34:11.970 --> 00:34:13.610
It's all because of that psycho. What the hell is this?

380
00:34:15.100 --> 00:34:16.880
Damn it, why am I standing in the front?

381
00:34:21.750 --> 00:34:24.320
Grow up, you punks.

382
00:34:33.030 --> 00:34:34.070
Are you ready?

383
00:34:37.320 --> 00:34:38.759
Bring it on.

384
00:34:38.760 --> 00:34:43.250
You bastard sons of bitches.

385
00:34:59.050 --> 00:35:01.819
I will announce the results of the disciplinary committee.

386
00:35:01.820 --> 00:35:04.889
As more than half of the attending committee members voted in favor,

387
00:35:04.890 --> 00:35:07.040
2nd-year student Pi Han-wool...

388
00:35:07.550 --> 00:35:09.030
Is given an expulsion penalty.

389
00:35:10.100 --> 00:35:12.619
If student Pi Han-wool is dissatisfied with the result,

390
00:35:12.620 --> 00:35:16.830
He may apply for a retrial to the Ministry of Education's Disciplinary Adjustment Committee...

391
00:35:19.640 --> 00:35:22.790
You must have met good teachers and good friends too.

392
00:35:23.710 --> 00:35:25.509
You chose to be ungrateful

393
00:35:25.510 --> 00:35:27.870
And let yourself fall this far.

394
00:35:28.500 --> 00:35:30.289
So now you have to take responsibility

395
00:35:30.290 --> 00:35:31.290
And reflect on yourself.

396
00:35:36.890 --> 00:35:38.900
Then an opportunity to change your life

397
00:35:39.910 --> 00:35:40.930
Will appear again.

398
00:36:02.380 --> 00:36:03.479
Pi Han-wool.

399
00:36:03.480 --> 00:36:04.740
Come with me.

400
00:36:05.330 --> 00:36:06.390
Excuse me, what is this about?

401
00:36:12.690 --> 00:36:15.300
Are you guys... really planning to hurt me?

402
00:36:16.130 --> 00:36:16.920
What's wrong?

403
00:36:17.560 --> 00:36:19.800
Did you think what happened to that teacher last year was just a rumor?

404
00:36:21.120 --> 00:36:22.890
I'm afraid it won't be that simple this time.

405
00:36:32.900 --> 00:36:34.390
Why would the police come to school?

406
00:37:02.740 --> 00:37:04.260
Just try to change the school and see.

407
00:37:10.830 --> 00:37:12.469
I know.

408
00:37:12.470 --> 00:37:13.450
I'm going, aren't I?

409
00:37:13.451 --> 00:37:14.990
Wait a minute...

410
00:37:16.370 --> 00:37:18.499
Let me smoke a cigarette before I go.

411
00:37:18.500 --> 00:37:19.690
What?

412
00:37:31.060 --> 00:37:32.610
No smoking on campus.

413
00:37:33.040 --> 00:37:34.570
Former Vice Principal.

414
00:37:37.510 --> 00:37:39.930
Let's go to school.

415
00:37:53.790 --> 00:37:54.620
People.

416
00:37:55.550 --> 00:37:56.610
Change every day.

417
00:37:57.010 --> 00:37:58.889
(Even in hell, I will create an opportunity)
Hey, you really... Catch me if you can.

418
00:37:58.890 --> 00:37:59.820
(Even in hell, I will create an opportunity)
You can't catch me, right?

419
00:38:01.860 --> 00:38:02.660
Gotcha.

420
00:38:02.660 --> 00:38:03.380
No you didn't.

421
00:38:03.381 --> 00:38:08.239
Yet despite this,
people still often say 'people cannot be changed'.

422
00:38:08.240 --> 00:38:09.839
(Even in hell, I will create an opportunity)

423
00:38:09.840 --> 00:38:12.219
Recently causing a stir on social media...

424
00:38:12.220 --> 00:38:15.069
(Ancheon High School Thug Brawl Revealed as Fabricated)
The thug brawl incident at a high school in Ancheon...

425
00:38:15.070 --> 00:38:17.239
Has been revealed to be a fabrication.

426
00:38:17.240 --> 00:38:19.829
The students who clashed with the security company employees

427
00:38:19.830 --> 00:38:22.430
Were not thugs attempting to steal property.

428
00:38:29.730 --> 00:38:31.749
Perhaps it's because, rather than changing for the better,

429
00:38:31.750 --> 00:38:33.910
People more often develop in a bad direction.

430
00:38:37.470 --> 00:38:38.290
Come in.

431
00:38:44.600 --> 00:38:46.680
Lawyer Hwang is here regarding Han-wool's matter.

432
00:38:48.120 --> 00:38:49.690
He can probably figure it out himself.

433
00:38:54.580 --> 00:38:55.910
Therefore, we...

434
00:38:56.820 --> 00:38:58.290
Struggle even harder.

435
00:38:59.890 --> 00:39:01.390
(Yuseong Tech. Delete this app?)
(Cancel / Confirm)

436
00:39:05.660 --> 00:39:06.490
(Soft Tofu)
(Note: It is a Korean tradition to eat tofu upon release from prison.)

437
00:39:09.710 --> 00:39:11.850
In order to become a better me than yesterday.

438
00:39:12.840 --> 00:39:13.570
Damn it.

439
00:39:15.600 --> 00:39:17.499
-You come here. -What's wrong?

440
00:39:17.500 --> 00:39:18.839
When did you get out?

441
00:39:18.840 --> 00:39:19.790
Why are you doing this?

442
00:39:26.170 --> 00:39:28.030
Even in hell,

443
00:39:28.510 --> 00:39:29.850
(Late Oh Jung-hwa)
I will create an opportunity.

444
00:39:31.420 --> 00:39:33.990
(Hello, this is YB Investment.
Congratulations on passing our internship.)

445
00:39:45.460 --> 00:39:47.039
Firefighter?

446
00:39:47.040 --> 00:39:48.239
Don't you think it's totally badass?

447
00:39:48.240 --> 00:39:49.760
Helping people in danger.

448
00:39:50.760 --> 00:39:52.700
(Yuseong 1st Study Group)
Wow, so fucking cool.

449
00:39:54.980 --> 00:39:55.950
Super cool.

450
00:39:55.951 --> 00:39:57.520
Really super annoying.

451
00:39:59.320 --> 00:40:00.560
Hee-won, what did you write?

452
00:40:01.330 --> 00:40:02.430
Programmer.

453
00:40:03.100 --> 00:40:03.890
Suits you well.

454
00:40:04.650 --> 00:40:06.049
It really feels super fitting.

455
00:40:06.050 --> 00:40:06.830
Ji-woo, what about you?

456
00:40:07.950 --> 00:40:10.470
Ji-woo is a teacher as always.

457
00:40:10.930 --> 00:40:12.299
You won't hit the students, right?

458
00:40:12.300 --> 00:40:13.229
Hey.

459
00:40:13.230 --> 00:40:14.750
Are you crazy? How dare you hit students.

460
00:40:17.000 --> 00:40:17.770
What about you?

461
00:40:19.150 --> 00:40:19.920
Me?

462
00:40:20.860 --> 00:40:23.020
I haven't decided yet.

463
00:40:25.220 --> 00:40:26.319
Ga-min.

464
00:40:26.320 --> 00:40:27.110
What about you?

465
00:40:27.960 --> 00:40:28.490
What?

466
00:40:28.491 --> 00:40:29.620
What is your dream?

467
00:40:30.450 --> 00:40:31.660
A dream...

468
00:40:33.970 --> 00:40:35.550
Mine is going to college.

469
00:40:42.800 --> 00:40:43.580
What's wrong?

470
00:40:44.530 --> 00:40:49.420
Because normally, people don't call "being a college student" a dream.

471
00:40:51.730 --> 00:40:52.650
Is that so?

472
00:40:54.400 --> 00:40:57.980
But is there a rule for that?

473
00:40:58.350 --> 00:40:59.110
What?

474
00:40:59.111 --> 00:41:02.140
Although it seems a bit hard to achieve right now...

475
00:41:02.560 --> 00:41:05.070
But something that can be achieved if you work hard until the end...

476
00:41:06.010 --> 00:41:07.420
Isn't that what a dream is?

477
00:41:10.890 --> 00:41:12.989
So studying hard and going to college...

478
00:41:12.990 --> 00:41:14.640
Is my dream right now.

479
00:41:24.270 --> 00:41:26.610
Alright, Study Group members.

480
00:41:28.310 --> 00:41:29.130
Finally...

481
00:41:34.040 --> 00:41:37.080
The finals schedule is finally out.

482
00:41:38.740 --> 00:41:40.380
Seriously.

483
00:41:41.490 --> 00:41:42.729
Damn it.

484
00:41:42.730 --> 00:41:43.750
How long do we have to take exams?

485
00:41:44.200 --> 00:41:45.759
I will definitely beat Lee Joon this time.

486
00:41:45.760 --> 00:41:46.889
You won't win.

487
00:41:46.890 --> 00:41:47.490
I will win.

488
00:41:47.490 --> 00:41:48.090
You won't win.

489
00:41:48.090 --> 00:41:48.810
I will win.

490
00:41:48.810 --> 00:41:49.510
You won't win.

491
00:41:49.510 --> 00:41:50.320
I'm going to poke your eyes out.

492
00:41:50.320 --> 00:41:50.880
You won't win.

493
00:41:50.880 --> 00:41:51.380
I told you to shut up.

494
00:41:51.380 --> 00:41:52.180
You won't win.

495
00:41:54.220 --> 00:41:56.440
This is Ancheon Yuseong Technical High School.

496
00:41:57.920 --> 00:41:59.350
Our story of getting into college...

497
00:42:00.270 --> 00:42:02.000
Is to be continued.

498
00:42:03.570 --> 00:42:07.610
"Study Group"

499
00:43:24.440 --> 00:43:26.060
Your grades improved a lot this time.

500
00:43:29.570 --> 00:43:30.630
Looks like you've been working hard.

501
00:43:32.680 --> 00:43:33.640
How is it?

502
00:43:33.641 --> 00:43:35.259
(God Teacher Lee Han-kyung)

503
00:43:35.260 --> 00:43:36.700
(Teacher Lee Han-kyung, we love you and will forever thank you)

504
00:43:37.600 --> 00:43:38.909
Try hard to improve by another 10 points.

505
00:43:38.910 --> 00:43:40.770
(Academic Affairs Manual)

506
00:43:42.570 --> 00:43:45.840
(Resignation Letter)

507
